  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4002.01 Automatic closure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4002.01 “Automatic closure” means a device or mechanism that causes a spill-proof system or spout to close, seal, and remain completely closed when not dispensing fuel.\n\nSource. #8358, eff 5-26-05; ss by #9064, eff 1-9-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4000.html"
